I thought some of you might want to know of a recent bug we have found with
DU 4.0A.

This is a problem which occurs if you have AdvFS Volumes mounted and run
quotacheck (or vquotacheck) with the -a option. After doing this df will
show all AdvFS Volumes with the same amount of usage as the last AdvFS
Volume.

The solution is to run an individual quotacheck for each fs. 

Another undocumented feature!



