The only problem I had with compiling GCC 2.7.2.1 under DU 4.0A was with
g++.  I got it to compile with this little patch, which works around a
prototype conflict:

*** gcc-2.7.2.1/cp/errfn.c~	Wed Oct 11 19:28:54 1995
--- gcc-2.7.2.1/cp/errfn.c	Wed Sep 11 10:59:52 1996
***************
*** 195,201 ****
       char *format;
       arglist_dcl
  {
!   extern errorfn sprintf;
    cp_thing (sprintf, 0, format, arglist);
  }
  
--- 195,201 ----
       char *format;
       arglist_dcl
  {
!   extern int sprintf();
    cp_thing (sprintf, 0, format, arglist);
  }
  


-- 
