Here is an entry form our printcap file:
grumpy|GRUMPY DWERG|GRUMPY:\
        :lf=/usr/adm/lperr:\
        :lp=:\
        :rm=grumpy:\
        :rp=raw:\
        :sd=/usr/spool/lpd/grumpy:

If this doesn't help maybe you need top upload the firmware of your
Jetdirect card, our cards work on firmware A.05.05 (on a J2552A)

Software for uploading jetdirectcards  is at http:\\www.hp.com\


Anton



