system PRIVILEGED account (root) wrote:
: Hi everyone:-
:         I am using Digital Unix 4.0a on Alpha 4100. I was wondering how a user
: (in telnet session) can print to his/her printer attach to PC.
:     If anyone can help me, I will appriciate it .
: Thanks.


The following script should work if your terminal emulator is smart enough
to handle printer controller mode escape sequences:

#
echo -n 'ESC[5i'               #printer controller mode on
cat your_file
echo -n 'ESC[4i'               #printer controller mode off


'ESC' is escape character.

Regards,
Kari Hassinen



